    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2NidJm7Tzd128tJp4sbpQtK)_\n\nRemoves from `sp-faces` (org source first, `.el` to match):\n- the `svg-tag-mode` setup (`prog-mode` hook and `svg-tag-tags`);\n- `M-x sp-org-heading-svg-tags-mode` and its helpers (#260).\n\nThe terminal setup was already removed in #261, apart from `eat`. `eat` stays because `claude-code` uses it and nothing links it to the hang.\n\nEmacs still hangs at start. The backtrace on quit shows `file-watch--add-kqueue`, which points at `org-mem-updater-mode` watching `~/notes`, not at svg-tag-mode. That is not changed here.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBTiUziZidcdSerB8r)_",
    "changed_files": 2,
    "closed_at": "2026-11-02T18:23:11Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "The `tangle` check is red only for `libraries/modules/base/navi/sp-search.el`, which this PR does not touch. It is the same drift that was red on #261 and is on `main`. `sp-faces` tangles to what is committed. I'm not widening this PR to fix it.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
